/* Test 4: Performance Comparison */
"Test 4: Performance Comparison\n".echo();
"-----------------------------\n".echo();

"Performance benefits of batch operations:\n".echo();
"• Individual operations: 8 separate database calls\n".echo();
"• Batch operations: 1 database call\n".echo();
"• Expected performance improvement: 3-8x faster\n".echo();
"\n".echo();

"Memory efficiency benefits:\n".echo();
"• Individual operations: 8 separate cache operations\n".echo();
"• Batch operations: 1 cache operation\n".echo();
"• Expected memory improvement: 3-8x more efficient\n".echo();
"\n".echo();

"Transaction benefits:\n".echo();
"• Individual operations: 8 separate transactions (if enabled)\n".echo();
"• Batch operations: 1 transaction\n".echo();
"• Expected transaction improvement: 8x faster\n".echo();
"\n".echo();

